  "title": "What is a deal room, and what should it include?",
  "summary": "A deal room, also called a digital sales room, is a shared and personalized web space where a seller and a buying group access everything tied to a deal through one link: the business case, pricing, demos, references, a mutual action plan, and next steps. It replaces scattered email attachments and shows the seller exactly who engaged with what.",
